        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In parallel with our efforts to reduce our Scope 1 and 2 emissions, we continue to prioritize innovation and product design that focuses on increasing the overall energy efficiency of our product offerings.",
