        "filing_date": "2026-02-20",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that the broad scope of the Company's product portfolio, plus the scale of its go-to-market capabilities, positions it to offer customers a unique and compelling value proposition.",
